    core: "Life Path 4 is the builder's number in numerology. Four is the number of corners, seasons and foundations, and people on this path are often described as practical, methodical and loyal. Where the 3 sketches an idea, the 4 asks how it will actually stand up: what it costs, what order the steps go in, who is responsible for each part. The title, The Builder, points to a love of solid work and lasting results. A 4 tends to trust effort over luck and evidence over enthusiasm, and they often become the dependable centre of a family, team or community. Stability is the keyword that runs through most readings, which can mean both providing it for others and needing it themselves in order to feel at ease. Many 4s feel calm when they know the plan, and uneasy when they are asked to improvise without one.",
